{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:a32639f19137567a","name":"Medical Officer","source":{"id":"source:reference-a32639f19137567a","title":"Medical Officer","revision":19983,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:58:42Z","sha256":"4578f00172cd61c3f064a64ba417f4e1395a9dbb0720367c13a60a2ae6ac4a2d","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19983","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Medical%20Officer&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-a32639f19137567a","blocks":[{"tag":"table","children":["\n\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["This section was titled Medic in its official source, but has been renamed to distinguish it from the similarly named \"",{"tag":"a","children":["Medic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Medic","referenceId":"reference:25877b98fccba1d5"},".\""]}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Medical Officer is responsible for making sure the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," remains a healthy fighting force. The Medical Officer coordinates a team of combat physicians who oversee the general welfare of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"},". A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," can have only one Medical Officer at a time.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The below Actions include all Actions that can be performed while functioning as a Medical Officer:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Actions"}]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Provide Medical Assistance"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["By spending three ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Actions"},", the Medical Officer can administer basic first aid to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"},". After spending the third ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", make a DC 20 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"}," check. If the check succeeds, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," heals 5 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},". However, the Battalion's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," cannot exceed the next highest ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attrition"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attrition"}," number. For example, a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Trooper Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Trooper_Battalion","referenceId":"reference:fc462e7b74175fda"}," with 60 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," can be healed only up to 63 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},", the next highest ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attrition"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attrition"}," number.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
